      "created_at": "2012-03-13T13:16:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually one thing about what happened is that if you draw the last card you do not reshuffle the deck, it isn’t until after you need to draw a card that you reshuffle, so Forced Deployment would of still brought back all the minions. I’m sorry about having to be the fun police.</p>",
