      "created_at": "2012-03-13T20:08:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sorry but I think you are wrong. We had to go through the rule book to find out exactly what happens. This is what we found: “Additionally, if any deck ever runs out of cards, simply shuffle that deck’s trash and put it into play” (p 6 under Gameplay). According to the wording, you have to shuffle the trash and put it into play as the deck as soon as that deck runs out of cards.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:00:12.921Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
